{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-155461" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following diagrams shows all the $6$th roots of unity?" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6a6c81c309733e2fd171e536d0333de2fe7e99174c0db69fe79c7509a9e2466"} {"question" "q-155461" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Geometrically, the $6$th roots of unity have the following properties:\n\n- all of them lie on the unit circle centered in the origin,\n\n- one of the roots is $1,$ corresponding to the point $(1,0)$ on the complex plane,\n\n- the roots form a regular hexagon (regular $6$-sided polygon).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/923d1a1b87833551ae6c451f15a6b5d8bdd75623e8d5c20e86357894bc24683d.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6a6c81c309733e2fd171e536d0333de2fe7e99174c0db69fe79c7509a9e2466"} {"question" "q-155461" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7d5e176c1965e6036719caa783a0abccebf7775082213f63da199413b30a0882"} {"question" "q-155461" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6a6c81c309733e2fd171e536d0333de2fe7e99174c0db69fe79c7509a9e2466"} {"question" "q-155461" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/1404