hem lie on the unit circle centered in the origin,\n\n- one of the roots is $1,$ corresponding to the point $(1,0)$ on the complex plane,\n\n- the roots form a regular nonagon (regular $9$-sided polygon).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/d8a917138beb862f6816fc059847659b1ba11e17d6a7a4906309b021baf1d3e5.png)" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6a6c81c309733e2fd171e536d0333de2fe7e99174c0db69fe79c7509a9e2466"} {"question" "q-162311" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7d5e176c1965e6036719caa783a0abccebf7775082213f63da199413b30a0882"} {"question" "q-162311" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/state.json" "file_sha256" "b6a6c81c309733e2fd171e536d0333de2fe7e99174c0db69fe79c7509a9e2466"} {"question" "q-162311" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/0525436f0f1ea9283c783bf590ae6dd58408ba5d5e2e6f69fc83af86e470864d.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/59cc6771efc546ca0b6ff4fe7b9fd7a1e7794c20240052c3d8e4e29ad114ec8d.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/b4510002c6e424de6ea16f3037237ea9628b0ddd61f7fa4643d412b66b4fd749.png"] ["image" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043589/assets/d8a917138beb862f681